1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,595
April 2018. Brooklyn, New York.

2
00:00:02,895 --> 00:00:05,284
Khabib was days away from fighting for the title.

3
00:00:05,584 --> 00:00:07,269
Conor wasn't even on the fight card.

4
00:00:08,069 --> 00:00:11,611
That week, he and his team tracked down Conor's friend, Artem Lobov.

5
00:00:11,911 --> 00:00:14,001
Khabib grabbed him by the neck, and slapped him.

6
00:00:14,801 --> 00:00:16,849
Word reached Conor. He flew to New York.

7
00:00:17,149 --> 00:00:20,563
He headed straight for the arena, where fighters were doing media day.

8
00:00:21,363 --> 00:00:25,181
At the arena's loading dock, Khabib was sitting on a bus with other fighters.

9
00:00:25,481 --> 00:00:26,847
Conor and his crew rushed in.

10
00:00:27,147 --> 00:00:29,835
Conor grabbed a metal dolly, and threw it through a window.

11
00:00:30,635 --> 00:00:35,136
Glass flew. Fighters Michael Chiesa and Ray Borg were hurt, and their fights were cancelled.

12
00:00:35,436 --> 00:00:37,057
Lobov was pulled from the show too.

13
00:00:37,857 --> 00:00:41,548
Conor was arrested. He later pleaded guilty to disorderly conduct.

14
00:00:41,848 --> 00:00:45,027
He had to do community service, and an anger management course.

15
00:00:45,827 --> 00:00:48,685
Two days after the attack, Khabib won the title anyway.

16
00:00:48,985 --> 00:00:52,484
He beat Al Iaquinta, a late replacement, over five rounds.

17
00:00:52,784 --> 00:00:54,320
Now everyone wanted one fight.

18
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:55,836
Part three: Las Vegas.

